"8046",""
"8047",""
"8048","Al-Qa'nabi reported that Abdulrahman ibn Abdullah ibn Umar Al-Umari narrated from Suhail, from his father, from Abu Hurairah, who said that the Messenger of Allah ﷺ  said, 'Whoever performs an act that the people of Lot (Sodom and Gomorrah) did, then they should be stoned, both the perpetrator and the receiver.'"
